---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Tell Hyphos where growth is still constrained by disconnected information, manual coordination, or key-person dependency."
>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 pt-20 sm:pt-28 pb-12">
    <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Contact</div>
    <h1 class="display text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight text-ink-900">
      Where is growth getting stuck?
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
      Tell us where work still depends on someone carrying the whole picture between systems. We'll write back within two business days—usually with a quick reaction, a couple of questions, and a time to talk if it makes sense.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 pb-20">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] gap-10">
      <div class="card p-7">
        <h2 class="display text-xl text-ink-900 mb-5">Email is the fastest way</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          A few sentences is plenty. Tell us what the business is trying to handle, which people or systems the work keeps routing through, and what starts slipping when volume rises.
        </p>

        <a
          href="mailto:info@hyphos.io?subject=New%20conversation&body=Hi%20Hyphos%20—%0A%0AA%20bit%20about%20us%3A%0A%0AWhat%20we're%20working%20on%3A%0A%0AWhere%20we're%20stuck%3A%0A%0AThanks%2C%0A"
          class="btn-primary"
        >
          info@hyphos.io
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
        </a>

        <div class="rule my-7"></div>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-2">What to include</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm text-ink-600 space-y-1.5">
          <li>· Who you are &amp; what your organization does</li>
          <li>· Where growth creates more manual coordination</li>
          <li>· What you've already tried, if anything</li>
          <li>· Which people the process depends on today</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="display text-base text-ink-900 mb-2">Platform deployment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
            Want our integrated business platform shaped for your industry? Mention what you do, what you're running today, and what's most painful — we'll know quickly whether we're a fit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="display text-base text-ink-900 mb-2">Hyphos / hyphos.io</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
            For early access to Hyphos, the best route is the waitlist at <a href="https://hyphos.io" class="link">hyphos.io</a>. We onboard a small cohort each quarter.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="display text-base text-ink-900 mb-2">Press &amp; partnerships</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
            <a href="mailto:info@hyphos.io" class="link">info@hyphos.io</a> — we'll route you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
